挡住看不到，才收回视线。“芷烟，进去休息下吧，最近凡儿病着，你都没有好好休息。”叶氏在门槛上坐下，折腾了这一通原本就累的身子，此刻觉得更累了。“嗯，娘也跟我一起去休息吧。”贾氏走过去扶起她，一起进了偏房去休息。蜿蜒细小的山道上，苏小凡一手拿着篮子，一手扶着腰，气喘吁吁的靠坐在一块大石头上：“啊，年纪大了，爬个山真是累死人了。”走在前面的萧遗墨回身不耐烦的冲她吼：“小老太婆，你倒是走快点啊。”“你才是小老太婆，你全家都小老太婆，人家我这不是才十五岁吗。”苏小凡站起身，随手从山道间捡了一根粗粗的树枝，拄着慢悠悠的朝上面走去，这原本就才刚刚大病初愈，又只才喝了一碗粥，没力气爬山是肯定的呀。而且为何摘个野菜是要上山啊，田间就没有野菜吗？在原本苏小凡那得来的记忆里，摘野菜确实都是在山上的。废了九牛二虎之力，她终于爬到了半山腰，将篮子丢在一边，眺目望去，这个山沟沟还真的是穷呀，从这看去，住户是少的可怜，而且每一家都隔了好远的距离，田间也只稀稀疏疏的栽种了一些水稻，许多田都废弃了。按记忆中来看，这个方圆百里的乡村，也就那么几十户人家，其中最为显眼的就是远处，隐隐约约看不大清晰的那一个相对来说比较像样的院子，那就是村长的家。“发什么呆，赶紧的，一会儿天就要黑了。”萧遗墨站在她身后，四下扫了扫，他可是从未上山摘过野菜啊，那传说中的野菜究竟为何物？苏小凡回过神来，拾起地上的篮子，四下看了看，见到了几株熟悉却又陌生的绿色植物后，蹲下身子将其自根部摘下放进篮子里。萧遗墨好奇的从篮子里拿起那株在他眼里，跟杂草无异的植物，端详了半天后，疑问出声：“这玩意儿真的能吃？”苏小凡虽然没有吃过，但是记忆中这家人一直都是吃这种东西度日的，淡淡的回：“吃不死你，放心吧。”“小爷我也要吃这玩意儿？”萧遗墨瞪大黑眸，面色复杂的看向苏小凡。“是啊，俗话说，嫁鸡随鸡嫁狗随狗，你既然是我的小夫君了，自然得跟我吃一样的东西。”苏小凡看也未看他一眼，走走停停，忙碌的采摘着野菜，这山太高了，既然上来了，就多摘一些好了，免得明天还得再跑一次。萧遗墨撅着粉嫩的小嘴，一脸不悦的跟在她身后，看着她瘦弱的身子不时的蹲下站起，走几步又蹲下站起。“呼……终于满了。”奋斗了大半个时辰，绕了好长一段，才摘满一篮子的野菜，苏小凡坐在地上，抬手擦拭着额上的细汗，这具身子着实太过营养不良，忙碌这么一会儿，就觉得头昏眼花了。“喂，你看那边有只兔子。”身侧传来萧遗墨兴奋的声音，苏小凡抬眼看去，就见他已经迈着短短的小腿儿去追远处一只跑得无比欢畅的肥兔子。“宝贝儿，别追了，就你那小短腿这么可能追上那只兔子呀，省点力气吧。”苏小凡若有所思的看着那只即将跑没影的兔子，四下扫了几眼后，起身朝一个茂密的草丛间走去。果不其然，草丛中有一窝出生不久的小兔子，三只麻灰的一只黑色的，此刻正一脸惊慌的看着她，无奈站不起来，跑不了。苏小凡兴奋的跑回去拎过满满的一篮子野菜，扯了些嫩草覆盖在面上做成一个小窝的形状，将几只小白兔轻轻的放了上去，顺手在附近摘了几棵兔子爱吃的苦苣菜。“你要把它们抓回去吃了吗？”萧遗墨喘着气儿折返了回来，满脸烦躁，要是放在以前，那只肥兔子早就变成自己的晚餐了。“才不是，多可爱啊，抓回去养起来，”苏小凡笑嘻嘻的回，而后又说：“等养肥了说不定能生小兔子哦，生小兔子后就把它们杀来吃了。”“还不是都要吃了。”萧遗墨忍不住翻翻白眼，将手中的几朵野蘑菇放进了她的篮子里。“你找到的啊？有了这个，晚上就可以弄的好吃点了。”苏小凡伸手将眼看着就要掉到地上的几朵野蘑菇往篮子里挪了挪，却没敢挪太进去，怕挤到蓝中的小兔子。萧遗墨对那几个野蘑菇没抱多大希望，野菜什么的想去也不好吃。－－－－－－题外话－－－－－－新文，求收求评各种求~！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongfuchengyin-nongjiatongyangxi/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 Marry a chicken and follow a chicken. Do you think I'm an idiot when Xiao Yimo throws it at her? With a look in his eyes, he replied calmly: \"My wife is just here to warm the bed.\" Su Xiaofan pursed his lips. Looking at his appearance just now, she thought he would say something shocking. Mrs. Ye came back, reached out and touched Xiao Yimo's head and said, \"There is still some porridge left in the pot. I have to let the young master drink porridge with Fan'er tonight.\" \"I looked before and there wasn't much left in the pot. What are grandma and mother eating?\" Su Xiaofan remembered that he seemed to have forgotten to take back the food from those people just now. \"I'll pick some wild vegetables and come back later.\" Mrs. Ye glanced at Mrs. Jia, and then at her belly. When the village chief's family sends money tomorrow, she must first buy some nutritional supplements for Zhiyan. Otherwise, she won't have the energy to have a baby, but it will cause death. She never wants to give a white-haired person to a black-haired person. \"Grandma, rest at home, I'll go.\" After saying this, Su Xiaofan walked into the kitchen, picked up a basket with a broken edge, put the kitchen knife in it, and prepared to walk towards the back mountain. After taking a few steps, I felt that the hem of my skirt was caught by something. I looked back doubtfully and met a pair of clear black eyes. \"Baby, do you want to go too?\" Su Xiaofan looked at Xiao Yimo who was tugging at the hem of her skirt, then looked up at the tall mountain behind the house, and said, \"Mountain climbing is very tiring. I won't hug you.\" Xiao Yimo rolled his eyes at her: \"Master I can leave by myself.\" Su Xiaofan raised his lips and smiled: \"Hehe, let's go then.\" Jia said to the two of them worriedly: \"Fan'er, you have to watch the young master and don't fall.\" \"Mom, don't worry.\" Su Xiaofan turned around and smiled sweetly at Jia. Jia watched their backs all the way up the mountain uneasily. She didn't look back until they were blocked by trees. \"Zhiyan, go in and have a rest. Fan'er has been ill recently, and you haven't had a good rest.\" Ye sat down on the threshold, tossing her already tired body, and now she felt even more tired. \"Well, mother, please come and rest with me.\" Jia walked over and helped her up, and they went into the side room to rest together. On the winding mountain road, Su Xiaofan held a basket in one hand and supported his waist with the other, panting and sitting on a big rock: \"Ah, I'm old, climbing a mountain is really tiring.\" Xiao Yimo, who was walking in front, turned around and shouted at her impatiently: \"Little old woman, you should walk faster.\" \"You're the only one. She is a little old woman, your whole family is a little old woman, and I am only fifteen years old.\" Su Xiaofan stood up, picked up a thick branch from the mountain path, and walked slowly up the mountain. He had just recovered from a serious illness, and he only drank a bowl of porridge. It was definitely not enough to climb the mountain. And why do you have to go up the mountain to pick wild vegetables? Are there no wild vegetables in the fields? In Su Xiaofan's original memory, picking wild vegetables was indeed done in the mountains. After exhausting all her efforts, she finally climbed halfway up the mountain, threw the basket aside, and looked around. This ravine was really poor. From this point of view, there were very few households, and each household was separated by a long distance. Only some rice was sparsely planted in the fields, and many fields were abandoned. According to memory, there are only a few dozen households in this village with a radius of hundreds of miles. The most conspicuous one is the relatively decent courtyard in the distance that is vaguely visible, and that is the village chief's home. \"Why are you dazed? Hurry up, it will be dark soon.\" Xiao Yimo stood behind her and looked around. He had never gone up the mountain to pick wild vegetables. What are the legendary wild vegetables? Su Xiaofan came back to his senses, picked up the basket on the ground, looked around, and after seeing a few familiar but unfamiliar green plants, he squatted down, picked them from the roots and put them into the basket. Xiao Yimo curiously picked up the plant from the basket that was no different from a weed in his eyes. After looking at it for a long time, he asked, \"Is this thing really edible?\" Although Su Xiaofan had never eaten it, his family had always lived on this kind of food in his memory. He replied calmly: \"It won't kill you, don't worry.\" \"Master, I want to eat this thing too?\" Xiao Yimo widened his black eyes and looked at Su Xiaofan with a complex expression. \"Yes, as the saying goes, if you marry a chicken, you will marry a dog. Since you are my little husband, you naturally have to eat the same thing as me.\" Su Xiaofan didn't even look at him. He walked and stopped, busy picking wild vegetables. This mountain is too high. Since you are up here, you should pick more, so as not to have to run again tomorrow. Xiao Yimo pouted her pink mouth and followed her with an unhappy look on her face. He watched her thin body squat down and stand up from time to time, then squat down and stand up again after walking a few steps. \"Huh... it's finally full.\" After struggling for more than half an hour and walking around for a long time, Su Xiaofan sat on the ground and raised his hand to wipe the sweat from his forehead. His body was too malnourished. After working for so long, he felt dizzy. \"Hey, look there's a rabbit over there.\" Xiao Yimo's excited voice came from beside him. Su Xiaofan looked up and saw that he was already using his short legs to chase a fat rabbit running happily in the distance. \"Baby, stop chasing. You can catch up with that rabbit with your short legs. Save your energy.\" Su Xiaofan looked thoughtfully at the rabbit that was about to disappear. After glancing around for a few times, he got up and walked towards a dense grass. Sure enough, there was a nest of newly born little rabbits in the grass, three gray and one black. They were looking at her in panic, unable to stand up or run away. Su Xiaofan ran back excitedly and picked up a basket full of wild vegetables. He pulled some young grass and covered it to make a small nest shape. He gently placed a few little white rabbits on it and picked a few chicory plants nearby that rabbits loved to eat. \"Are you going to catch them back and eat them?", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}